lection): Automatically teleports your character to \"LemonTree\" objects and uses the ClickDetector to collect fruit. It also disables collision on these trees to ensure smooth movement.\n\nAuto Collect Bags: Automatically detects and teleports the character to money bags or cash items dropped around the map to collect them quickly.\n\nAuto Phone Deals: Scans the in-game phone interface and automatically accepts deals/options provided by the game, saving you from manually clicking through the menus.\n\n3. Utility & Navigation\n\nTeleport System: Provides a pre-configured list of fast-travel buttons to key locations, including:\n\nPoints of Interest: Vine Key, Vine Door, Exit Sewers, UFO Key, Alien, and Void Altar.\n\nBase Return: A dedicated button to teleport you back to your starting tycoon location.\n\nAnti-AFK: Includes logic to detect if the game is about to kick you for being idle, simulating user input (moving/jumping) to keep you active.\n\nAuto Rejoin: Attempts to automatically reconnect you to the server if the game errors or crashes.\n\n4. User Interface & Tracking\n\nKey System: A security layer requiring a specific key to unlock the full menu, with a quick-link button to join a Discord server.\n\nMonitoring GUI: An on-screen status monitor that tracks:\n\nCurrent FPS.\n\nReal-time Cash count.\n\nStatistics of actions performed (Total buys, upgrades, rebirths, and phone deals).\n\nVisual indicators (ON/OFF) for all active automation toggles.\n\nCustomizability: The interface is fully draggable and contains organized tabs (Main, Farm, Teleports) for easy navigation.","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://pastefy.app/GZaqMS9V/raw\"))() \n","owner":{"_id":"68e7e4ac0a4d2f0cfa5a240d","username":"mohammedirfan1987","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","status":"offline","id":"68e7e4ac0a4d2f0cfa5a240d","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1}},"verified":false,"views":1085,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal"